WEBVTT

00:23:59.320 --> 00:24:02.666
they're prone to anxiety,
depression and self-harm.

00:24:02.690 --> 00:24:05.373
They're also more likely
to face malpractice claims.

00:24:06.660 --> 00:24:10.536
Remember -- demand, control, support.

00:24:10.560 --> 00:24:15.066
To fight burnout, the Cleveland Clinic
started by reducing demands.

00:24:15.090 --> 00:24:18.656
One of the most frustrating job demands
is electronic overload.

00:24:18.680 --> 00:24:21.983
Digital demands are overwhelming
many people in many jobs.

00:24:22.906 --> 00:24:25.716
I bet you've been there,
looking at your phone from your bed

00:24:25.740 --> 00:24:28.093
and feeling like you just can't keep up.

00:24:28.960 --> 00:24:32.029
There are some researchers
who put those habits to good use.